  "caption": "The video depicts an industrial workshop interior where a bearded man wearing a yellow hard hat and high-visibility vest stands before two large orange robotic arms. He holds a tablet in his left hand and a stylus in his right, initially looking down at the device. As the sequence continues, his head lifts and his gaze turns toward the camera while the tablet rotates in his hands from a near-horizontal position to a vertical one. Its dark face becomes pointed outward, and he draws it closer against his torso. The stylus shifts orientation to point downward beneath the tablet. The robotic arms remain stationary behind him, with black end-effectors and cabling visible. A slow tightening of the framing makes the man and background machinery appear slightly larger. He maintains direct eye contact with the camera while holding the tablet upright against his chest.",
